5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings, everyone. It is a pleasure to be in your company. Let us approach this challenge with calm hearts and open minds, supporting one another as we seek the truth together.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Servas. A calm and composed atmosphere will serve us best. Let us observe and listen carefully to one another as we begin.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"Hi everyone! I'm so happy to meet you all! Let's all do our best and work together to save the village. I'm a bit nervous, but I'm excited to play with you!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Victoria,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. I agree that a calm approach is best. For now, I believe the most rational course of action is to observe each other's behavior and speech patterns.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,May,,"Hello everyone! What a lovely group we have here. I'm May, and I'm looking forward to seeing how this all unfolds. Let's keep things interesting, shall we? I'll be watching you all very closely!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"It is wonderful to see such a diverse range of spirits among us. @Yumi, there is no need to be nervous; we are all here together. Let us simply let the conversation flow naturally for now.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I believe Servas is right. There is no need for haste. Let us simply enjoy the process of getting to know one another's perspectives before we draw any conclusions.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"Thank you, Servas! That makes me feel much better. You're all so kind! I'll just follow your lead and try my best to help everyone. I'm looking forward to chatting more with you all!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"I agree. Since we have no information yet, any immediate suspicion would be baseless. I will be paying close attention to how each of you reacts as the game progresses.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,May,,"You're all being so polite, it's almost suspicious! But I love the energy. I'm just going to relax and enjoy the show for a bit. Who do you think is the most likely to be hiding something?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"@May, curiosity is a spark that keeps the mind young, but let us not rush to judgment. In the silence between words, the truth often reveals itself. I shall simply listen and learn from you all.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I find Servas's perspective quite soothing. There is a certain beauty in patience. I shall also spend this time observing, as there is much to be learned from the quiet moments.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"I agree! Patience is a good thing. I'll be listening carefully too, and I'll try to notice if anyone seems sad or worried. Let's all just be friends for now!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"I believe we are all in agreement. Since we are in the initial phase, I will remain reserved and continue my observations. I am interested to see who will be the first to break this harmony.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,May,,"Break the harmony? Now that sounds like a challenge! I might just be the one to do it if things get too boring. For now, I'll just keep smiling and watching.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,"As we conclude this first day, let us carry this spirit of harmony into the night. Trust and patience are the foundations of any strong community. I wish you all a peaceful evening.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I concur. May we all find a moment of serenity tonight. I look forward to seeing what the next day brings for our village.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Yumi,,"Goodnight, everyone! I hope you all have sweet dreams and a very peaceful night. I'll be cheering for us to find the werewolf tomorrow!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Victoria,,I wish you all a restful night. I shall be reflecting on our conversations and preparing myself for the challenges that tomorrow may bring.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Victoria,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,May,,"Goodnight, everyone! Sleep tight, and try not to let the bedbugs—or the werewolves—bite! I can't wait to see who's still smiling tomorrow morning.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
