36,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all rested well. As the sun rises, let us once again gather with kindness and clarity. Does anyone have any insights or revelations to share with the village?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I hope your night was peaceful. As Servas suggests, it is time to see if any clarity has emerged. I am curious to know if the Seer has found any leads to guide us.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Good morning! I slept great, thank you! I'm really hoping the Seer found someone suspicious so we can protect everyone. Does anyone have any news? I'm all ears!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I have information. May, I am the Seer, and my divination has revealed that you are the werewolf. It is a heavy realization, but for the safety of the village, I must speak the truth.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,May,,"What a dramatic start! Victoria, I'm flattered you spent your first night thinking about me, but that is a complete lie. Are you really the Seer, or just trying to take me out early?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Servas,,"This is a sudden and heavy revelation. @Victoria, your courage in speaking so early is noted, but @May, your reaction is equally spirited. Let us breathe and consider this carefully before we act in haste.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It is indeed a startling beginning. While Victoria's claim is direct, we must consider the risk. If she is the Seer, we have found our target; if she is the werewolf, she is attempting a swift elimination.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"Wow, this is so sudden! I can't believe it! Victoria, are you really sure? And May, you seem so surprised! I don't want to believe anyone is lying, but we have to be careful for the village!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I am certain. My divination was clear and unambiguous. While I understand the risk of revealing my role so early, the risk of leaving a known werewolf among us is far greater. I ask you to trust the evidence.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, you're playing this very straight, aren't you? It's almost too perfect. If you're the werewolf, this is a brilliant way to frame me. Everyone, don't let her calm demeanor fool you into a mistake!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Servas,,"In times of conflict, it is often the most composed voices that guide us, yet we must not let composure blind us to the truth. @Victoria, @May, please understand that your words carry the weight of a life today.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I find myself torn. Victoria's conviction is striking, yet May's defense is spirited. In such a delicate balance, we must ask ourselves if the Seer would truly risk their life so early, or if a werewolf is simply being bold.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I'm really torn too! I want to believe both of you because you've both been so nice, but we have to save the village. @Victoria, @May, is there anything else that can help us decide? I don't want to make a mistake!","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"The only evidence I can provide is the result of my divination. If I were the werewolf, claiming the Seer's role to eliminate a villager would be a gamble that exposes me. I am acting for the village's survival.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,May,,"@Yumi, don't let her ""sacrifice"" act fool you! It's not a gamble if she's the werewolf and has a Possessed friend helping her push the vote. It's a trap! I'm a villager, and Victoria is just a very good actress.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Servas,,"We have reached the moment of decision. While the heart wishes for peace, the mind must seek the truth. I believe Victoria's resolve is sincere, and I shall place my trust in her guidance. Let us vote for May.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I must admit, the situation remains precarious. However, Victoria's unwavering composure is quite compelling. To ignore the Seer's claim would be a grave risk to our collective safety. I will follow the majority and vote for May.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I really don't want to do this, but I have to think about everyone's safety. Victoria seems so sure, and I trust her kindness. I'm sorry, May, but I'll vote for May.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"I appreciate your trust. It is a difficult decision, but the evidence is absolute. For the sake of the village, we must proceed. I vote for May.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,May,,"This is unbelievable! You're all just going to fold that easily? I'm the one being honest here, and you're choosing a fairy tale over me! Fine, do what you want, but don't come crying to me when you realize you've killed a villager. I vote Victoria!","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
